speechtext:
1.	Did the war assets corporation sell any assets to the city of Salaberry of Valleyfield in 1944, 1945, 1946, and 1947?
2.	If so (a) what were such assets; (b) what was the quantity of each kind in each year; (c) what was the selling price of each of such assets;
(d)	when and where was each delivery made;
(e)	on what date were such assets paid for?

This afternoon the hon. member for Mackenzie (Mr. Nicholson) was speaking along the same line as the hon. member is now. I asked him this question: Did he
[Mr. Knowles.}
advocate the repeal of order in council 2115 and thus bring all immigrants under order in council 695? I asked him then: Would he then have immigration under order in council 695 with the clause regarding Asiatic immigration deleted from it? And his answer was, Yes. Is that the hon. gentleman's answer?
